# How to get these values (free, no credit card required):
# 1. Install the Turso CLI: curl -sSfL https://get.tur.so/install.sh | bash
# 2. turso auth login
# 3. turso db create monthly-budget-app
# 4. turso db show monthly-budget-app --url          -> TURSO_DATABASE_URL
# 5. turso db tokens create monthly-budget-app        -> TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN

